 **An operator is banned iff all its bonds ∈ D.** At 3 + 4 that averages ≈22 banned operators. The briefing shows lit and greyed bonds plus the banned list; the in-match dropdown shows banned counts per bond. The rule reproduces a real screenshot's counts (7/6/5/5/5/4/3) exactly (01 A2).
 
+**Remake adjustment (owner decision 2026-10-13, not official):** with the two custom core bonds (东/乌萨斯) the core pool grew 8 → 10, so the draw is **5 core + 5 add-on** in NORMAL/HARD/ABYSS (config `data/config.json → bans`, built by tools/build-data.mjs) — scaled to keep the average available operators at the 0.2.1 baseline of ≈90 (MC: 0.2.1 3+4 → 22.0 banned / 90.0 available; 10-core 5+5 → 33.5 / 91.5). The draw still only filters the shop pool: a drawn bond stays activatable (computeBonds never reads the ban set) — its members that survive (multi-bond ones via their other bonds, plus 调和's +1) still reach the thresholds; only 阿戈尔 shows a real (2.7 %) risk of not even reaching its lowest tier with 调和. Weight remains a draw-eligibility gate, not a sampler weight.
+
+**Remake adjustment 2 (owner decision 2026-10-17, not official):** 协防干员 (`emptyShip`) joins the draw — its `weight` goes 0 → 10 in `tools/custom-content.mjs` (`BOND_WEIGHT_OVERRIDES`, applied in `injectCustomContent` before any builder), so the add-on pool is **12**. 投资人 (`investShip`) explicitly stays weight 0 = never banned (调和 / 绝技 too). Self-selected (`自选编队`) pieces are exempt from the 协防 ban: `server/match/player/diy.js → buildDiyStock` drops `economy.fallbackBondId` from a DIY record's bonds before the all-bonds-off test, so a factionless pick and every prototype (all `['emptyShip']`) keep their stock — the player-facing promise "协防不会被禁用" holds. The draw is **5 core + 5 add-on** with a **weighted** sample (2026-10-17 second ruling, supersedes the interim 7+4): `pool.js → sample()` draws each bond with probability ∝ `bond.weight` (sequential PPS without replacement; equal weights ⇒ the old uniform shuffle), scale 10 = "normally drawable". Weights (`custom-content.mjs BOND_WEIGHT_OVERRIDES` + the custom-bond template): 远见/奇迹 (visi/mira) **2.5 = 0.25×** (user asked to suppress them — draw rate 41.7 % → 9.1 %), 迅捷/精准/灵巧 (swift/preci/skillful) **45 = 4.5×** (83.7 %, the compensating pressure — suppressing 远见/奇迹 alone does NOT move the total: the mean expected-banned over the 792 add-on subsets containing them equals the mean over those without, 32.246 vs 32.250), everything else 10; 自制 东/乌萨斯 bumped 1 → 10 to match the scale. production `drawDisabledBonds` × 200 k seeds: 35.07 banned / **89.93 available** (0.2.1 anchor: 22.0 / 90.0); 投资人 0.00 %. Full evaluation: 禁用机制速查.md §12 (interim 7+4, archived) and §13 (current).
+
+**Remake adjustment 3 (owner decision 2026-10-17, after the 雷姆必拓 integration — current rule):** the pool is now 132 visible chess with **11 core bonds** (东/乌萨斯/雷姆必拓 + 8 official), and the draw is **6 core + 5 add-on**, still **weighted** by `bond.weight` (`pool.js → sample()`, sequential PPS, 10 = "normally drawable"). Weights (`custom-content.mjs BOND_WEIGHT_OVERRIDES`, applied in `injectCustomContent` **after** the custom-bond injection since the three custom cores are in the table too): 精准 (preci) **50 = 5×** (the strongest lever, forced-draw impact +1.73 banned), 灵巧/迅捷/坚守/助力 30 = 3×, 萨尔贡/阿戈尔 20 = 2×, 远见/奇迹 (visi/mira) 2.5 = 0.25× (owner asked to suppress them; draw rate 8.8 %), 协防/独行/不屈 5 = 0.5× (still drawable at 17.1 % — they are NEGATIVE-impact bonds: drawing one displaces a high-impact bond and lowers the total), everything else 10. production `drawDisabledBonds` × 1 M seeds: 40.42 banned / **91.58 available** vs the pre-merge live 7+5-uniform baseline 41.08 / 90.92 — both dials essentially unchanged. 投资人 (investShip) stays weight 0 = never banned; 自选 pieces remain exempt from the 协防 ban (`diy.js buildDiyStock`); the PR3 放回保底 (every drawn bond keeps tmin−1 usable members) sits on top in `pool.js`. Full evaluation: 禁用机制速查.md §13 (5+5 without rim, archived) and §14 (current).
